@3 felt dizzy.
The air next to the river was heavy with naphtha fumes and breathing it nearly made him pass out. "Are you ósure this leads out?"
@5 nodded. "Delekhan placed a few others of my clan here. They told me how they escaped. But first, we have to find Obkhar and assist him in whatever he needs."�

